      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPECIAL ENVOY (1) made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (21.91) at Shepparton over 390m. Can measure up this time. HE'S A COLLINDA (4) was drawn the middle last start but pinged the lids and recorded an all-the-way win (24.89) at Sale in a Free For All over 435m. Has never been out of the placings from three starts out of this box. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. AMRON MICK (6) didn't fire two runs back then progressed nicely last time to be beaten just 1.75 lengths into third over 400m at this track. In the mix.",
